      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Current workaround:\n- Set a render bool to false.\n- In Start(), set a global render variable. GetComponent<Renderer>();\n- In OnWillRenderObject(), if render bool is false, set it to true.\n- In Update(), if render bool is true, check if renderer.isVisible, if not visible, set render bool to false",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
