      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I tested this in VRCSDK3 2021.06.03.14.57 and can confirm that this is still broken. \nWhile I was able to trigger the events in play mode (using U# and CyanEmu), they did not trigger in VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null
